@anon.a6b6a9a55df1a6fb8afb47e1f078e4b4.756 = private unnamed_addr constant [675 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for uses of deprecated Airflow functions and values that still have\0Aa compatibility layer.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AAirflow 3.0 removed various deprecated functions, members, and other\0Avalues. Some have more modern replacements. Others are considered too niche\0Aand not worth to be maintained in Airflow.\0AEven though these symbols still work fine on Airflow 3.0, they are expected to be removed in a future version.\0AThe user is suggested to replace the original usage with the new ones.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Afrom airflow import Dataset\0A\0A\0ADataset(uri=\22test://test/\22)\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Afrom airflow.sdk import Asset\0A\0A\0AAsset(uri=\22test://test/\22)\0A```\0A", align 1
