@anon.a6b6a9a55df1a6fb8afb47e1f078e4b4.963 = private unnamed_addr constant [355 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for three or more consecutive if-statements with direct returns\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AThese can be simplified by using a dictionary\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Aif x == 1:\0A    return \22Hello\22\0Aelif x == 2:\0A    return \22Goodbye\22\0Aelse:\0A    return \22Goodnight\22\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Areturn {1: \22Hello\22, 2: \22Goodbye\22}.get(x, \22Goodnight\22)\0A```\0A", align 1
