@anon.a6b6a9a55df1a6fb8afb47e1f078e4b4.982 = private unnamed_addr constant [488 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for an empty type-checking block.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AThe type-checking block does not do anything and should be removed to avoid\0Aconfusion.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Afrom typing import TYPE_CHECKING\0A\0Aif TYPE_CHECKING:\0A    pass\0A\0Aprint(\22Hello, world!\22)\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Aprint(\22Hello, world!\22)\0A```\0A\0A## References\0A- [PEP 563: Runtime annotation resolution and `TYPE_CHECKING`](https://peps.python.org/pep-0563/#runtime-annotation-resolution-and-type-checking)\0A", align 1
