@anon.a6b6a9a55df1a6fb8afb47e1f078e4b4.1041 = private unnamed_addr constant [721 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for uses of `await` outside `async` functions.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AUsing `await` outside an `async` function is a syntax error.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Aimport asyncio\0A\0A\0Adef foo():\0A    await asyncio.sleep(1)\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Aimport asyncio\0A\0A\0Aasync def foo():\0A    await asyncio.sleep(1)\0A```\0A\0A## Notebook behavior\0AAs an exception, `await` is allowed at the top level of a Jupyter notebook\0A(see: [autoawait]).\0A\0A## References\0A- [Python documentation: Await expression](https://docs.python.org/3/reference/expressions.html#await)\0A- [PEP 492: Await Expression](https://peps.python.org/pep-0492/#await-expression)\0A\0A[autoawait]: https://ipython.readthedocs.io/en/stable/interactive/autoawait.html\0A", align 1
